data: {"id": "1a409041eade47ac-thinking-parallel_evidence-1462", "run_id": "1a409041eade47ac", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "基于已有工具结果，整理对该 Pod 证据如下：\n\n### 实体与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6`\n- **状态**: `phase: Running`，`Ready: False`。`Restart Count: 0`。\n- **Node**: `node2/10.2.0.50`，IP: `172.16.104.26/32`\n\n### 事实与候选原因\n\n**1. NotReady 根因确认为 Readiness Probe 持续失败**\n- **kubectl_describe** 显示 `Ready: False`，并包含两类探针失败事件：\n  - `connection refused`: 43m 前 `Get \"http://172.16.104.26:8080/ready\": dial tcp ... connect refused`。\n  - `503`: 随后长达 43m 内 `HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` (x830 over 43m)。\n-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1788460730707, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

