data: {"id": "1a409041eade47ac-final", "run_id": "1a409041eade47ac", "seq": 1467, "ts_ms": 1788460747737, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6` | NotReady | Pod aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6 NotReady |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Ready=False, message: containers with unready status: [app] (fact-02b6d7664166, fact-bc216e61fd2a) | 直接表征 Pod 处于不可服务状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Readiness probe failed: dial tcp 172.16.104.26:8080/ready: connection refused (fact-68e95d7b1eef); statuscode: 503 (fact-6ae1215dc458) | 探测机制直接报错，连接拒绝与 HTTP 503 交替出现 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | 聚合日志模式 `dependency unavailable`，http_status=503，path=/work (fact-103b104836e0) | 证实应用内部逻辑在处理依赖时发生阻断并对外返回 503 |\n| 4 | Tracing | deepflow+tempo | Flow: src=172.16.104.19 -> dst=172.16.104.26, HTTP GET /work -> 503 (fact-132812f93a47) | 网络流量数据在 L7 层复现了探测失败与日志报错的同一现象 |\n\n证据链表明：探测机制（K8s Event）在 172.16.104.26:8080 收到失败响应，这直接导致 Pod 状态标记为 NotReady。深层观测确认了 Pod 内部在 /work 接口处理请求时，因“依赖不可用”而主动抛出 503，这与追踪日志中捕获的 HTTP 流量及应用日志完全吻合，证明了外部不可达性源于应用内部对上游依赖的故障处理。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nApplication dependency unavailable → Readiness Probe HTTP 503 → ContainersNotReady → Pod NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为**应用依赖不可用导致就绪探针（Readiness Probe）连续失败**。\n依据：\n- K8s Event 与 Tracing 数据显示应用端点（172.16.104.26:8080）对外返回 503 并伴随连接拒绝；\n- Logging 事实明确指出错误根源在于 `dependency unavailable`。\n\n未确认部分：日志中仅提示“依赖不可用”，未提供具体的下游服务名或根本源头（如网络中断、上游故障或配置错误），因此具体的故障起点待进一步排查。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 111.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 111.2s (Evidence 103.8s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 138.775, "metrics": {"run_id": "1a409041eade47ac", "mttr": {"value": "2.3m", "seconds": 138.78176641464233, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 138781.76641464233, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 90322.07345962524, "tool_calls": 26, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 8, "successful_tool_calls": 26, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 44971.020221710205, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 22126.816749572754}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18048.293828964233, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 111188.9100074768, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9523.4694480896, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

